\itemize{
\item Poisson-Lognormal
\item Poisson-Generalized-Exponential
\item Poisson-Lindley-Gamma (more efficient than using hypergeometric
functions)
\item Poisson-Lindley-Lognormal
\item Poisson-Weibull
